<title>TAIWAN: First Int'l 1st quarter profit soars.</title>
<headline>First Int'l 1st quarter profit soars.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 1997</p>
<p>			 (in million T$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Turnover				 7,581 vs   6,433</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			   711 vs     258</p>
<p>    Net profit				 645 vs     245</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name is First International Computer Inc, Taiwan's second largest computer firm. The company did not give a reason for the profit rise.</p>
</text>
